   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_54d72088cb52b5200bb9",
   "sourceHash": "54d72088cb52b5200bb93e8dcf92817ba672120c61fd0e32bcb02cd5d2ce0cb3",
   "text": "瑜伽项目如何实现个性化？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6797eac485830c273ef7",
   "sourceHash": "6797eac485830c273ef789758f4ea560cc3868c15e9c8e444efe230b232a2bb4",
   "text": "项目时长和费用是多少？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e9cd31a237c23c979f38",
   "sourceHash": "e9cd31a237c23c979f389a6899f7fb871ce26fccab4d68d5d3a48fa81dde23ee",
   "text": "量身定制的项目——费用依据医生制定的方案而定。请咨询项目时长以及您计划入住期间的现行安排。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b8f5d9b8686a54dbe31f",
   "sourceHash": "b8f5d9b8686a54dbe31f0f8f5d3c0d1c3cda59ca6dd281a322573c3bd47bcc68",
